<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to contact us about your experience at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b style=""><font size="2">-<i>If Dangerous Goods Complaint add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">To ensure your travel is comfortable and safe, it's important that your baggage complies with our dangerous goods policy. Dangerous Goods are items that may endanger the safety of an aircraft or persons on board the aircraft and their carriage is governed by the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the Civil Aviation Safety Authority Regulations.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret you were not aware of the rules around -<i>item- </i>being taken on board and understand your disappointment when it had to be -<i>checked-in, surrendered etc- </i>but our customers’ wellbeing is at the core of everything we do here at Qantas and we will not compromise on safety.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If no space in overhead add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We strive to accommodate our customers’ needs, but there is a limited amount of storage on board, so we need to limit the amount of carry-on in the aircraft cabin. There are times when our crew will have to move items to another part of the cabin or ask customers to put any smaller items under the seat in front, to make adequate space. When this happens we appreciate our customers understanding.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">Inconsistency of Policy add:</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If Previously allowed add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I note your comment that you were not stopped with your multiple overweight bags at {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} and I apologise if our staff do not seem to be applying our baggage rules consistently. Our Airport Manager in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} will want to address this matter with the relevant staff members there, so thank you for bringing it to our attention.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If staff were rude add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am sorry that our staff were not as courteous as expected and have certainly passed this information on to our Airport Management to take up with the staff working on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}.&nbsp;</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We appreciate you taking the time to let us know what happened and look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>